# Which machine holds which host name. Tracked so that two machines
# cannot end up with the same name -- see steps/11-hostname.sh.
#
# machine-id is sha256(hardware serial), first 12 chars. The serial
# itself is deliberately not recorded.
#
# Retiring a machine? Delete its line. That frees the name.
#
# Using a fork of this repo for several machines? Commit this file after
# `HOST_SHORT=<name> ./setup.sh`, so the next machine sees the name is taken.
#
# name             machine-id      claimed
